<title>UK: TABLE-Prism Rail yr profit 6.9 mln stg.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Prism Rail yr profit 6.9 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>14 months to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>(million stg unless stated)</p>
<p>Shr (pence) after exceps  37.7 loss</p>
<p> Shr (pence) pre-exceps    32.1</p>
<p> Pretax pre-exceps	   6.9</p>
<p> Turnover			199.2</p>
<p> Exceptional costs	   12.4</p>
<p> Pretax after exceps	 5.5 loss</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the British railway operator is Prism Rail Plc. The company said it would not pay a final dividend but planned an interim dividend in December 1997. The figures are the company's first full set of results since its acquisition of four rail franchises and flotation on the Alternative Investment Market.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
</text>
